<title>JAPAN: OSE mulls new market for large-lot trading.</title>
<headline>OSE mulls new market for large-lot trading.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said it was preparing to create a new market by the end of this year for large-lot cross trading and basket trading, an OSE official said.</p>
</text>
